---
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={site.tagline} />
    <title>{site.title}</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light dark;
        --bg: #fcfcfa;
        --fg: #1a1b1e;
        --muted: #5c5e66;
        --accent: #c6462f;
        --line: #e6e4df;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --bg: #101114;
          --fg: #e8e8e6;
          --muted: #a0a2a8;
          --line: #2a2b30;
        }
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -20%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent), transparent),
          var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      main {
        width: min(40rem, 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, white);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        font-family: "Noto Serif SC", "Songti SC", serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .tagline {
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .status {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      code {
        font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 0.9em;
      }
      ol {
        margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>{site.name}</h1>
      <p class="tagline">{site.tagline}</p>
      <p class="status">
        占位页已就绪。连通链路：GitHub → Cloudflare Pages →
        <code>www.nuonuoya.cn</code>。进站 Turnstile 验证见
        <code>/gate/</code> 与 <code>CONNECT.md</code>。
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>本地 <code>npm run dev</code> 预览</li>
        <li>推送 <code>main</code> → GitHub → Pages 自动构建</li>
        <li>生产环境配置 Turnstile 密钥后，访问首页会先进入验证页</li>
        <li>阿里云 DNS 保持 NS 不动，仅 <code>www</code> CNAME</li>
      </ol>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
